   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the real property actions and proceedings law, in relation to\nrequiring a petition in a summary proceeding to recover possession of real\nproperty in the city of Schenectady to allege proof of compliance with local\nlaws requiring rental residential property registration and licensure",
    "basePrintNo": "S5675",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5675-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §741, RPAP L",
    "lawSection": "Real Property Actions and Proceedings Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S5675\n\nSPONSOR: TEDISCO\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the real property actions and proceedings law, in\nrelation to requiring a petition in a summary proceeding to recover\npossession of real property in the city of Schenectady to allege proof\nof compliance with local laws requiring rental residential property\nregistration and licensure\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo ensure that rental properties are safe and comply with local building\ncode\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThe People of the State of New York, represented in Senate and Assembly,\ndo enact as follows:\n\nSection 1. Section 741 of the real property actions and proceedings law\nis amended by adding a new subdivision 7 to read as follows:\n\n7. IN THE CITY OF SCHENECTADY, WHERE THE PREMISES FROM WHICH REMOVAL IS\nSOUGHT IS SUBJECT TO A LOCAL LAW REQUIRING THE REGISTRATION OF SAID\nPREMISES AS A CONDITION OF LEGAL RENTAL, ALLEGE PROOF OF COMPLIANCE WITH\nSUCH LOCAL LAW\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nShould an eviction be sought from a rental property, the property must\nbe registered and in compliance with local law.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n06/05/23: S.7547 REFERRED TO RULES\n\n01/03/24: S.7547 REFERRED TO HOUSING, CONSTRUCTION AND COMMUNITY DEVEL-\nOPMENT\n\n02/12/24: S.7547 1ST REPORT CAL 400\n\n02/13/24: S.7547 2ND REPORT CAL.\n\n02/14/24: S.7547 ADVANCED TO THIRD READING\n\n02/26/24: S.7547 AMENDED ON THIRD READING 7547A\n\n06/06/24: S.7547A PASSED SENATE\n\n06/06/24: S.7547A DELIVERED TO ASSEMBLY\n\n06/06/24: S.7547A referred to ways and means\n\n06/07/24: S.7547A substituted for a7656a\n\n06/07/24: S.7547A ordered to third reading rules cal.531\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to state.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect on the ninetieth day after it shall have\nbecome a law.\n",
